 "applies_to": "Cooper Lighting Solutions Greengate lighting control panel profile 808640000 (8 relays, 8 switch inputs, 64 remote points), connected over IP to a ProtoNode FPC-N34 gateway.",
 "summary": "A ProtoNode FPC-N34 reads a Greengate lighting relay panel over IP and presents it as a BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP device. The 808640000 profile has 8 relays, 8 switch inputs, 64 remote points, plus a panel reset. Relays and remote points are Binary Values; switch input states are Binary Inputs. Cooper marks this guide as discontinued (watermark dated 13-10-2023), so the list is for existing Greengate installations.",
